# Pyrrhic Strike with its blight paid targets Bot2's Lotus Petal (first mode) and Hero of Bladehold (second mode). In
# response Bot2 sacrifices Lotus Petal for {W} and with it exiles Hero of Bladehold with Swords to Plowshares: every
# target is illegal as the spell would resolve, so it doesn't resolve and does nothing (CR 608.2b), and goes to the
# graveyard. The blight was a cost, paid as it was cast: Endurance keeps its two -1/-1 counters.

